itda":26.9,"debt_to_ebitda":3.31,"net_debt_to_ebitda":2.04,"f_score":6,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 3.4%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $276M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 52.3%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 2.57"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":34.25,"default_fair_val":34.25,"premium_pct":239.1,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":79.1,"pe_forward":69.6,"pb_trailing":5.6,"pb_forward":5,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":6.2,"fcf_to_ev":3.72,"fcf_to_mcap":4.02,"liab_to_assets":52.3,"cash_to_assets":13.7,"current_ratio":2.57,"roe":7.1,"roa":3.4,"moat":{"ticker":"ELF","period":"2027Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"e.l.f. Beauty 在美妝市場展現出強勁的品牌實力與定價權。其品牌定位清晰，主打高品質、平價的產品，成功吸引了廣泛的消費者群體，尤其是在年輕一代中。這種品牌忠誠度使得 e.l.f. 能夠在不犧牲銷量的情況下，逐步提升產品價格，尤其是在推出創新產品或升級配方時。相較於競爭對手，e.l.f. 的產品組合更具吸引力，能夠在價格敏感的市場中維持較高的利潤率。其品牌價值不僅體現在產品本身，更在於其社群媒體的活躍度和消費者互動，形成了一種難以複製的品牌文化，這構成了其重要的定價壁壘。","comment_en":"e.l.f. Beauty demonstrates strong brand power and pricing ability in the beauty market. Its brand positioning is clear, focusing on high-quality, affordable products, successfully attracting a broad consumer base, especially among the younger generation. This brand loyalty allows e.l.f. to gradually increase product prices without sacrificing sales volume, particularly when launching innovative products or upgraded formulations. Compared to competitors, e.l.f.'s product portfolio is more attractive, enabling it to maintain relatively high profit margins in a price-sensitive market. Its brand value is reflected not only in the products themselves but also in its active social media presence and consumer engagement, forming a difficult-to-replicate brand culture, which constitutes a significant pricing barrier."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"美妝產業的專利與監管壁壘相對較低。e.l.f. Beauty 的產品主要依賴於配方和市場行銷，而非技術專利。雖然公司會遵守相關的化妝品安全法規，但這些法規對所有行業參與者都是通用的，並未構成 e.l.f. 獨有的競爭優勢。與製藥或高科技產業不同，美妝領域的創新迭代速度快，專利保護的時效性和廣度有限，難以形成長期、穩固的護城河。因此，在專利和監管方面，e.l.f. 的壁壘非常薄弱。","comment_en":"The barriers related to patents and regulations in the beauty industry are relatively low. e.l.f. Beauty's products primarily rely on formulations and marketing rather than technological patents. While the company complies with relevant cosmetic safety regulations, these regulations are common to all industry participants and do not constitute a unique competitive advantage for e.l.f. Unlike the pharmaceutical or high-tech industries, innovation cycles in the beauty sector are rapid, and the timeliness and scope of patent protection are limited, making it difficult to form a long-term, stable moat. Therefore, in terms of patents and regulations, e.l.f.'s barriers are very weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"美妝產品的轉換成本相對較低，消費者容易更換品牌。然而，e.l.f. Beauty 透過其獨特的品牌體驗和社群連結，在一定程度上增加了消費者的轉換成本。一旦消費者習慣了 e.l.f. 的產品品質、價格和品牌形象，並融入其社群互動，更換到其他品牌的意願就會降低。此外，e.l.f. 的產品線廣泛，能滿足消費者多樣化的需求，減少了他們尋找替代品的必要性。儘管如此，與金融服務或企業軟體相比，美妝領域的轉換成本仍屬中等偏低。","comment_en":"The switching costs for beauty products are relatively low, making it easy for consumers to change brands. However, e.l.f. Beauty, through its unique brand experience and community engagement, has to some extent increased consumer switching costs. Once consumers become accustomed to e.l.f.'s product quality, price, and brand image, and integrate into its community interactions, their willingness to switch to other brands decreases. Furthermore, e.l.f.'s extensive product line meets diverse consumer needs, reducing the necessity for them to seek alternatives. Nevertheless, compared to financial services or enterprise software, switching costs in the beauty sector remain moderate to low."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"e.l.f. Beauty 在網絡效應方面展現出中等水平的潛力，主要體現在其社群媒體的活躍度與消費者互動上。公司積極利用 TikTok、Instagram 等平台，鼓勵用戶生成內容（UGC），形成病毒式傳播效應。消費者對 e.l.f. 產品的分享和推薦，能夠吸引更多新用戶加入，形成正向循環。這種基於社群的網絡效應，雖然不像社交平台那樣直接，但有效地增強了品牌黏性，並降低了獲客成本。隨著社群影響力的擴大，這種效應會進一步鞏固其市場地位。","comment_en":"e.l.f. Beauty exhibits moderate potential in network effects, primarily reflected in its social media activity and consumer engagement. The company actively utilizes platforms like TikTok and Instagram, encouraging user-generated content (UGC) and fostering viral spread. Consumers' sharing and recommendations of e.l.f. products can attract more new users, creating a positive feedback loop. This community-based network effect, while not as direct as that of social platforms, effectively enhances brand stickiness and reduces customer acquisition costs. As its social influence expands, this effect will further solidify its market position."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"e.l.f. Beauty 透過其規模經濟和精實的供應鏈管理，建立了顯著的成本優勢。作為一家專注於大眾市場的品牌，其龐大的採購量和生產規模，使其能夠在原材料採購、生產製造和物流配送等方面獲得更低的單位成本。公司持續優化其供應鏈效率，與供應商建立長期穩定的合作關係，進一步降低運營成本。這種成本優勢使得 e.l.f. 能夠在保持高性價比的同時，維持健康的利潤率，並在價格競爭中佔據有利地位，構成了堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"e.l.f. Beauty has established a significant cost advantage through its economies of scale and lean supply chain management. As a brand focused on the mass market, its large procurement volumes and production scale allow it to achieve lower unit costs in raw material sourcing, manufacturing, and distribution. The company continuously optimizes its supply chain efficiency and builds long-term, stable relationships with suppliers, further reducing operational costs. This cost advantage enables e.l.f. to maintain healthy profit margins while offering high value for money and occupying an advantageous position in price competition, forming a solid moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"e.l.f. Beauty 的業務主要集中在北美市場，雖然其品牌在全球範圍內有一定知名度，但尚未形成獨特的地理資產壁壘。其產品的生產和銷售模式相對標準化，並未依賴於特定的地理位置或稀缺資源。雖然公司在不同市場的佈局有助於分散風險，但並未構成如同礦產、土地或特定區域市場領導地位那樣的獨特資產。因此，在獨特地理資產方面，e.l.f. 的護城河較為薄弱。","comment_en":"e.l.f. Beauty's business is primarily concentrated in the North American market. Although its brand has some global recognition, it has not yet formed a unique geographical asset barrier. Its product manufacturing and sales models are relatively standardized and do not rely on specific geographic locations or scarce resources. While the company's presence in different markets helps diversify risks, it does not constitute a unique asset like mineral resources, land, or a dominant market position in a specific region. Therefore, e.l.f.'s moat in terms of unique geographical assets is relatively weak."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"e.l.f. Beauty 在營運效率方面表現出色，尤其是在其供應鏈管理和產品開發週期上。公司能夠快速響應市場趨勢，高效地將新產品推向市場，這得益於其靈活的生產模式和與供應商的緊密合作。其精實的營運策略，有效控制了庫存和生產成本。此外，e.l.f. 在數位化轉型方面也投入甚多，利用數據分析優化營運流程，提升客戶體驗。這種持續的營運效率提升，為公司帶來了穩定的盈利能力和競爭優勢。","comment_en":"e.l.f. Beauty excels in operational efficiency, particularly in its supply chain management and product development cycles. The company can quickly respond to market trends and efficiently bring new products to market, thanks to its flexible production model and close collaboration with suppliers. Its lean operational strategy effectively controls inventory and production costs. Furthermore, e.l.f. has invested heavily in digital transformation, using data analytics to optimize operational processes and enhance customer experience. This continuous improvement in operational efficiency brings the company stable profitability and a competitive advantage."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"e.l.f. Beauty 在資本配置方面展現出穩健的策略。公司在維持健康的資產負債表、進行戰略性收購以及回購股份之間取得平衡。其對研發和市場行銷的投入，旨在鞏固品牌優勢和擴大市場份額。同時，公司也關注股東回報，透過適度的股票回購來提升股東價值。雖然其資本配置策略相對保守，但能夠在風險可控的前提下，支持公司的持續成長。與巴菲特偏好的極致資本配置相比，e.l.f. 仍有提升空間，但其現有策略已構成一定的護城河。","comment_en":"e.l.f. Beauty demonstrates a sound strategy in capital allocation. The company balances maintaining a healthy balance sheet, making strategic acquisitions, and repurchasing shares. Its investments in research and development and marketing aim to strengthen brand advantages and expand market share. Concurrently, the company focuses on shareholder returns through moderate share repurchases to enhance shareholder value. While its capital allocation strategy is relatively conservative, it supports the company's sustained growth under controllable risks. Compared to Buffett's preferred extreme capital allocation, e.l.f. still has room for improvement, but its current strategy already forms a certain moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"e.l.f. Beauty 在客戶留存方面表現優異，這主要歸功於其強大的品牌忠誠度和持續的產品創新。公司透過社群媒體互動、會員計畫和個性化推薦，有效維繫客戶關係。一旦消費者認可 e.l.f. 的品牌價值和產品質量，便傾向於重複購買。其不斷推陳出新的產品策略，能夠持續吸引消費者關注，並滿足其不斷變化的需求。這種高客戶留存率，不僅降低了獲客成本，也為公司帶來了穩定且可預測的營收，構成了堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"e.l.f. Beauty excels in customer retention, largely due to its strong brand loyalty and continuous product innovation. The company effectively maintains customer relationships through social media engagement, loyalty programs, and personalized recommendations. Once consumers recognize e.l.f.'s brand value and product quality, they tend to make repeat purchases. Its strategy of constantly introducing new products continuously attracts consumer attention and meets their evolving needs. This high customer retention rate not only reduces customer acquisition costs but also brings stable and predictable revenue to the company, forming a solid moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"e.l.f. Beauty 的商業模式展現出良好的持久性，儘管美妝市場競爭激烈且趨勢變化快速。其核心競爭力在於能夠持續提供高性價比的產品，並緊密連結消費者社群。這種模式使其能夠抵禦短期市場波動和競爭對手的挑戰。公司對品牌建設和客戶關係的長期投入，有助於維持其市場地位。雖然面臨新興品牌和技術的潛在顛覆，但 e.l.f. 透過其靈活的營運和對市場趨勢的敏銳洞察，展現出較強的適應能力和持久的競爭力。","comment_en":"e.l.f. Beauty's business model demonstrates good durability, despite the intense competition and rapid trend changes in the beauty market. Its core competitiveness lies in its ability to consistently offer high-value products and maintain close connections with its consumer community. This model allows it to withstand short-term market fluctuations and challenges from competitors. The company's long-term investment in brand building and customer relationships helps maintain its market position. Although facing potential disruption from emerging brands and technologies, e.l.f. exhibits strong adaptability and lasting competitiveness through its agile operations and keen insight into market trends."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"e.l.f. Beauty 的護城河主要建立在其強大的品牌定價權（M1）、顯著的成本優勢（M5）和卓越的客戶留存能力（M9）之上。公司成功地在大眾美妝市場中建立起高性價比的品牌形象，並透過社群媒體營運創造了中等的網絡效應（M4）。然而，其在專利與監管壁壘（M2）方面較為薄弱，轉換成本（M3）和獨特地理資產（M6）亦非其強項。總體而言，e.l.f. 展現出類似於「收費橋」的商業模式，透過規模經濟和品牌吸引力，在看似擁擠的市場中穩定獲利，其營運效率（M7）和資本配置（M8）亦有助於鞏固其市場地位，整體護城河為堅固等級。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"e.l.f. Beauty's moat is primarily built upon its strong brand pricing power (M1), significant cost advantages (M5), and excellent customer retention capabilities (M9). The company has successfully established a high-value brand image in the mass beauty market and created moderate network effects (M4) through its social media operations. However, it is relatively weak in patent and regulatory barriers (M2), and switching costs (M3) and unique geographical assets (M6) are not its strengths. Overall, e.l.f. exhibits a business model akin to a 'toll bridge,' generating stable profits in a seemingly crowded market through economies of scale and brand appeal. Its operational efficiency (M7) and capital allocation (M8) also help solidify its market position, resulting in an overall moat of a solid grade.","evidenceHash":"11348d934e59870b1fa3c0ea61ccce262ca96ffd6cd3f402ac5b3e8adc3f51e4","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"11348d934e59870b1fa3c0ea61ccce262ca96ffd6cd3f402ac5b3e8adc3f51e4","currentEvidenceHash":"11348d934e59870b1fa3c0ea61ccce262ca96ffd6cd3f402ac5b3e8adc3f51e4"},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T14:18:43.633Z","evidenceHash":"80dbc5fc1c103f0dcc7cf0491851111401b285196beef895902ee2e80e1b4479"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T14:18:43.633Z","evidenceHash":"80dbc5fc1c103f0dcc7cf0491851111401b285196beef895902ee2e80e1b4479"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ELF.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ELF.png","website":"https://www.elfbeauty.com","ceo":"Tarang Amin","full_time_employees":"849","description":"e.l.f. Beauty, Inc., a beauty company, provides cosmetics and skin care products worldwide. The company offers eye, lip, face, paw, and skin care products. It offers products under the e.l.f. Cosmetics, e.l.f. Skin, Well People, Naturium, and Keys Soulcare brand names. The company sells its products through national and international retailer and direct-to-consumer through its e-commerce channel. e.l.f. Beauty, Inc. was formerly known as J.A. Cosmetics Holdings, Inc. and changed its name to e.l.f. Beauty, Inc. in April 2016. The company was founded in 2004 and is headquartered in Oakland, California.","description_en":"e.l.f. Beauty, Inc., a beauty company, provides cosmetics and skin care products worldwide. The company offers eye, lip, face, paw, and skin care products. It 